# Shoot the Sheriff targets a non-outlaw creature of any controller: Bot1's own Pirate, Spyglass Siren, cannot be
# targeted, Bot1's own Ornithopter can and is destroyed. Cast again at Bot2's Ornithopter, Bot2 answers
# with Echoing Truth: the spell's only target is gone, so it does nothing as it resolves (CR 608.2b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Spyglass Siren
Ornithopter
Shoot the Sheriff
Shoot the Sheriff
Mox Jet
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island
Echoing Truth
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spyglass Siren.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Shoot the Sheriff.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Spyglass Siren)
Bot1.Hand.Shoot the Sheriff.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Shoot the Sheriff; Ornithopter
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Shoot the Sheriff.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Echoing Truth.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot2.Graveyard = Echoing Truth
Bot1.Battlefield.Spyglass Siren.Power = 1
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
